{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"想让对方知道的冲动接在H2的悬而未决、H5的防备松动和H7的独自承受之上，是允许补充的局部心理过程，而且写的是表达冲动而非实际告白或新保证。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"几乎说出口时的脆弱接上H2与H7，感受过满后的短暂停顿又有M42支持，且明确说明安静不代表疑问已经解决，没有新增实际告白或改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“把手握得更紧”加入了既有历史和候选中均未确立的具体身体动作，甚至可能暗示双方已有握手接触；虽然抵抗失去当下的心理因果接得上H6至H8，但这个动作属于未经依据补入的场景细节。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"当下的留恋直接接上H6中越在乎这段时间就越感到时间流逝的心理过程，以及H8对快乐正在过去的首次不安，M43也支持这种欢喜与不舍并存的因果，没有新增事件或改变主线。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条都交代了当下感受及其心理来由，4–16和17–23的编号虽只是背景定位，但相应的情绪经历已在文字中概括，因此不依赖听感记录也能读懂整体情感推进。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "09862e93-71a0-466c-9dc5-7a4d42619d09", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T134654581063Z", "elapsed_seconds": 259.265, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:51:13.848093+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "91f4a704efd8132b3a8d9d02123efe478cac226bdfba594afc574470eaa3c055", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_ret